Get Blockchain Info

- Information about a node and network it is part of

Fields:
- chain: name of the network 
- blocks: number if fully validated blocks on the node
- headers: 
- bestblockhash
- getblockchaininfo
- difficulty
- time
- mediantime
- verificationprogress 
- initialblockdownload: 
    - boolean 
    - indicates whether the node is still syncing from scratch 
- chainwork:
- pruned:
- warnings:
